Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: use Fast-mode I2C for dream2lteks speaker

Set the dedicated MAX98506 adapter to 400 kHz, the default rate
used for the same HSI2C controller by the Samsung Exynos8895 tree.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
@@ -524,6 +524,7 @@
 &hsi2c_11 {
 	#address-cells = <1>;
 	#size-cells = <0>;
+	clock-frequency = <400000>;
 	status = "okay";
 
 	g955n_speaker_amp: amplifier@31 {
